01:34:50.040 --> 01:34:52.620
it doesn't create some kind of case law precedent,

2055
01:34:52.620 --> 01:34:54.870
but certainly a chilling effect, right?

2056
01:34:54.870 --> 01:34:59.160
So what is the of implications of that settlement

2057
01:34:59.160 --> 01:35:02.090
and how does that impact how pharma kind of,

2058
01:35:02.090 --> 01:35:03.710
