01:35:05.207 --> 01:35:06.177
Yeah, sorry.
(Anne chuckling)

2061
01:35:06.177 --> 01:35:08.032
It's been a while.
No, no, it's good.

2062
01:35:08.032 --> 01:35:08.865
Since I flexed that muscle.

2063
01:35:08.865 --> 01:35:11.780
Well, so what's interesting settlements are, and again,

2064
01:35:11.780 --> 01:35:13.630
I'm not a lawyer, but this is what I've learned

2065
01:35:13.630 --> 01:35:15.740
through this, this experience.

2066
01:35:15.740 --> 01:35:18.770
So settlements can take many different forms.

2067
01:35:18.770 --> 01:35:21.393
This settlement that's in the offing, importantly,

2068
01:35:23.030 --> 01:35:27.270
the defendants are not admitting to wrongdoing, right?

2069
01:35:27.270 --> 01:35:30.210
But they're providing money to abate the harms

2070
01:35:30.210 --> 01:35:31.643
of the opioid epidemic.

2071
01:35:33.525 --> 01:35:38.525
And one of the things that looks like will come out of it

2072
01:35:38.780 --> 01:35:42.130
in terms of monitoring diversion,

2073
01:35:42.130 --> 01:35:44.020
or basically pills going to people

2074
01:35:44.020 --> 01:35:48.940
other than who was intended is a, some external agency,

2075
01:35:48.940 --> 01:35:53.200
which I think is really good, so to monitor diversion,

2076
01:35:53.200 --> 01:35:55.710
because essentially what's what we have now

2077
01:35:55.710 --> 01:35:59.500
is that the opioid pharmaceutical industry is supposed

2078
01:35:59.500 --> 01:36:01.370
to police itself.

2079
01:36:01.370 --> 01:36:03.150
And that has not worked out very well.

2080
01:36:03.150 --> 01:36:04.500
(both laughing)

