01:36:04.500 --> 01:36:05.347
It never does.

2082
01:36:05.347 --> 01:36:06.573
No. It never does.

2083
01:36:06.573 --> 01:36:07.920
Just like big tech.

2084
01:36:07.920 --> 01:36:11.015
I mean, the parallels here are unbelievable.

2085
01:36:11.015 --> 01:36:13.223
Yes, yes, that's right.

2086
01:36:13.223 --> 01:36:15.080
So, one of the major things that looks like

2087
01:36:15.080 --> 01:36:18.710
may come out of this settlement is a better policing system

2088
01:36:18.710 --> 01:36:22.020
that is not the industry itself policing itself,

2089
01:36:22.020 --> 01:36:24.970
but then also importantly, billions of dollars

2090
01:36:24.970 --> 01:36:26.870
going to states and counties to do things

2091
01:36:26.870 --> 01:36:29.113
like help treat opioid addiction.

2092
01:36:30.230 --> 01:36:32.130
You know, in the tobacco settlement

2093
01:36:32.130 --> 01:36:34.890
that was also what the money was intended for.

2094
01:36:34.890 --> 01:36:38.270
Most of the money went to balancing state and county budgets

2095
01:36:38.270 --> 01:36:41.280
