2100
01:36:49.870 --> 01:36:51.290
Importantly, this settlement

2101
01:36:51.290 --> 01:36:54.680
does not include monies going to affect it individuals

2102
01:36:54.680 --> 01:36:55.513
and their families.

2103
01:36:55.513 --> 01:36:58.520
It's a public nuisance claim, so it's going to states

2104
01:36:58.520 --> 01:37:01.480
and counties to address the community,

2105
01:37:01.480 --> 01:37:04.504
not on an individual claim.

2106
01:37:04.504 --> 01:37:05.870
Hmm.

2107
01:37:05.870 --> 01:37:06.703
That's interesting.

2108
01:37:06.703 --> 01:37:09.870
So where does that money get spent ultimately?

2109
01:37:09.870 --> 01:37:10.950
Yeah. Great question.

2110
01:37:10.950 --> 01:37:13.160
I mean, I think it's gonna be budgeted at the state

2111
01:37:13.160 --> 01:37:14.290
and county levels.

2112
01:37:14.290 --> 01:37:17.461
Right. Which means it's probably not gonna get spent

2113
01:37:17.461 --> 01:37:19.360
