01:38:37.610 --> 01:38:41.080
of medical practice and not siloed outside of that.

2142
01:38:41.080 --> 01:38:46.080
Yeah. 100% we need better rehabilitation across the board.

2143
01:38:46.140 --> 01:38:50.550
And that should be, especially with the opioid crisis

