2808
02:09:17.710 --> 02:09:20.990
why is TikTok, why can't I stop scrolling up

2809
02:09:20.990 --> 02:09:23.603
on these TikTok videos or whatever it is?

2810
02:09:25.050 --> 02:09:28.580
You know, my first intervention with most of my patients

2811
02:09:28.580 --> 02:09:30.920
in my clinic, whether they come in specifically

2812
02:09:30.920 --> 02:09:32.660
for a problem related to addiction,

2813
02:09:32.660 --> 02:09:34.890
or whether they come in for something else like depression,

2814
02:09:34.890 --> 02:09:38.210
