2815
02:09:38.210 --> 02:09:42.530
a lot of high dopamine substances or behaviors,

2816
02:09:42.530 --> 02:09:45.340
is to recommend a dopamine fast.

2817
02:09:45.340 --> 02:09:49.360
And that is a period of time abstaining from that drug

2818
02:09:49.360 --> 02:09:52.950
or that behavior that is causing the problem

2819
02:09:52.950 --> 02:09:54.300
or related to the problem.

2820
02:09:54.300 --> 02:09:58.090
And over, you know, the last 20 years

2821
02:09:58.090 --> 02:10:00.000
I've essentially evolved an intervention,

2822
02:10:00.000 --> 02:10:02.762
which is a month long dopamine first,

2823
02:10:02.762 --> 02:10:05.520
then the month is somewhat informed by the science,

2824
02:10:05.520 --> 02:10:06.870
and there are some interesting studies

2825
02:10:06.870 --> 02:10:09.370
that I talk about in my book, but essentially I tell people,

2826
02:10:09.370 --> 02:10:10.610
you know, you're gonna go into withdrawal

2827
02:10:10.610 --> 02:10:13.130
in the first two weeks, and by week four,

2828
02:10:13.130 --> 02:10:14.750
you'll probably be feeling better

2829
02:10:14.750 --> 02:10:17.080
as the gremlins hop off the pain side

2830
02:10:17.080 --> 02:10:20.020
and homeostasis is restore restored,

2831
02:10:20.020 --> 02:10:22.810
and you've generated more of your own dopamine.

2832
02:10:22.810 --> 02:10:25.650
You're not as fixated on that drug

2833
02:10:25.650 --> 02:10:27.290
and you're able to kind of get pleasure

