2835
02:10:29.300 --> 02:10:31.190
A lot of times patients will ask,

2836
02:10:31.190 --> 02:10:33.310
well, why can't I just reduce the amount?

2837
02:10:33.310 --> 02:10:35.570
And the reason I don't recommend that is 'cause,

2838
02:10:35.570 --> 02:10:37.330
it just usually doesn't work.

2839
02:10:37.330 --> 02:10:40.540
We really need to reset reward pathways,

2840
02:10:40.540 --> 02:10:42.970
and then if we decide to go back to using our drug

2841
02:10:42.970 --> 02:10:45.840
and moderation, put barriers in place

2842
02:10:45.840 --> 02:10:48.220
so that we can maintain moderation.

2843
02:10:48.220 --> 02:10:50.510
And by the way, most of my patients who come in

2844
02:10:50.510 --> 02:10:54.550
with even serious addictions after a month of abstaining

2845
02:10:54.550 --> 02:10:56.780
and feeling better when I asked them,

2846
02:10:56.780 --> 02:10:57.950
wow, things are so much better.

