02:10:57.950 --> 02:10:59.320
Do you wanna do another month?

2848
02:10:59.320 --> 02:11:01.360
Or do you wanna go back to using your drug?

2849
02:11:01.360 --> 02:11:04.550
In the vast majority of cases they wanna go back to using,

2850
02:11:04.550 --> 02:11:05.750
but they want to use less.

2851
02:11:05.750 --> 02:11:08.710
So then we talk about barriers and you know,

2852
02:11:08.710 --> 02:11:12.430
how they can engage in what I call self binding strategies

2853
02:11:12.430 --> 02:11:15.670
and other metacognitive strategies to moderate use.

2854
02:11:15.670 --> 02:11:17.610
And then it really is an experiment.

