02:11:24.350 --> 02:11:26.600
Sometimes people can moderate their use and then decide

2858
02:11:26.600 --> 02:11:27.640
it's just not worth it.

2859
02:11:27.640 --> 02:11:30.520
Like it's so exhausting to moderate use

2860
02:11:30.520 --> 02:11:32.180
that it's just easier to abstain.

2861
02:11:32.180 --> 02:11:35.519
Yeah. For me, abstinence is easier than moderating use.

2862
02:11:35.519 --> 02:11:37.063
Yes, exactly.

2863
02:11:37.063 --> 02:11:37.960
You just remove it completely.

2864
02:11:37.960 --> 02:11:42.030
And eventually you acclimate, but moderating use ends up

2865
02:11:42.030 --> 02:11:46.020
