2866
02:11:46.020 --> 02:11:47.160
but that's me, right?

2867
02:11:47.160 --> 02:11:52.160
So, that idea of abstinence followed by an experiment

2868
02:11:52.350 --> 02:11:55.300
of what re reframing your use looks like

2869
02:11:55.300 --> 02:11:58.013
will be information that will tell you how big of a problem

