Forget it.

2897
02:13:01.981 --> 02:13:02.814
Yeah. Forget it.

2898
02:13:02.814 --> 02:13:05.570
You have to anticipate it, have that barrier in place,

2899
02:13:05.570 --> 02:13:07.230
